y}^{″}(t)-4y(t)=-4,\\,y(0)=1,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=0\n$$\n\nis given by\n\n$$\n{s}^{2}Y(s)-s-4Y(s)=-\\frac{4}{s}.\n$$\n\nThe solution is $y(t)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379470 1113 #uuid "74a8f81e-ae52-5920-95ee-456b5a7bd468" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379470 1145 "Using the transformed equation, we can solve for $Y(s)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{s}^{2}Y(s)-s-4Y(s) & =-\\frac{4}{s} \\\\ ({s}^{2}-4)Y(s) & =s-\\frac{4}{s} \\\\ ({s}^{2}-4)Y(s) & =\\frac{{s}^{2}-4}{s} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{{s}^{2}-4}{s({s}^{2}-4)} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{1}{s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is valid for $s>2.$\n\nNow, taking the inverse Laplace transform, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}(Y(s)) & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s}} \\\\ y(t) & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379471 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379472 13194139536015 true] [17592186379471 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379473 13194139536015 true] [17592186379471 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536015 true] [17592186379471 1041 "field-1" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379471 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379472 13194139536015 true] [17592186379471 1110 #uuid "208824f9-ba12-5238-a14d-93ae23ea0cc4" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379472 1034 "1" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379472 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379472 1111 #uuid "1a3a4f28-b93a-5069-b49f-3aa613d10094" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379473 1034 "0" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379473 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379473 1111 #uuid "7bc4ac5f-8ad9-54f0-8f98-608d1d8e3494" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379474 1017 #edb/ref 17592186379475 13194139536015 true] [17592186379474 1089 "q-345078" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379474 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536015 true] [17592186379474 1100 "Find $y(t)$ given that the Laplace transform of the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-9y=-8{e}^{-t},\\,y(0)=2,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=2\n$$\n\nis given by\n\n$$\n{s}^{2}Y(s)-2s-2-9Y(s)=-\\frac{8}{s+1}.\n$$\n\nThe solution is $y(t)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379474 1113 #uuid "8cde5879-da5e-5bfd-ad35-d1683362d0b5" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379474 1145 "Using the transformed equation, we can solve for $Y(s)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{s}^{2}Y(s)-2s-2-9Y(s) & =-\\frac{8}{s+1} \\\\ ({s}^{2}-9)Y(s) & =2s+2-\\frac{8}{s+1} \\\\ ({s}^{2}-9)Y(s) & =\\frac{2({s}^{2}+2s-3)}{s+1} \\\\ ({s}^{2}-9)Y(s) & =\\frac{2(s+3)(s-1)}{s+1} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{2(s+3)(s-1)}{(s+1)(s-3)(s+3)} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{2(s-1)}{(s+1)(s-3)} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{1}{s+1}+\\frac{1}{s-3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is valid for $s>3.$\n\nNow, taking the inverse Laplace transform, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}(Y(s)) & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+1}+\\frac{1}{s-3}} \\\\ y(t) & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+1}}+{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s-3}} \\\\ y(t) & ={e}^{-t}+{e}^{3t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379475 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379476 13194139536015 true] [17592186379475 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379477 13194139536015 true] [17592186379475 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536015 true] [17592186379475 1041 "field-1" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379475 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379477 13194139536015 true] [17592186379475 1110 #uuid "89973892-42fe-5487-a484-8851acf3e058" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379476 1034 "e^{-t}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379476 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379476 1111 #uuid "6d02d649-29db-5cfc-9577-e75e23690bd2" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379477 1034 "e^{-t}+e^{3t}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379477 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379477 1111 #uuid "2b9ef45d-3bb0-5e09-8854-6a2c9d31f66e" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379478 1017 #edb/ref 17592186379479 13194139536015 true] [17592186379478 1089 "q-345083" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379478 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536015 true] [17592186379478 1100 "Find $y(t)$ given that the Laplace transform of the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}(t)+y(t)=7,\\,y(0)=7,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=0\n$$\n\nis given by\n\n$$\n{s}^{2}Y(s)+Y(s)=\\frac{7(1+{s}^{2})}{s}.\n$$\n\nThe solution is $y(t)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379478 1113 #uuid "c5309c60-b128-5b86-8386-d3be90c807dd" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379478 1145 "Using the transformed equation, we can solve for $Y(s)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{s}^{2}Y(s)+Y(s) & =\\frac{7(1+{s}^{2})}{s} \\\\ ({s}^{2}+1)Y(s) & =\\frac{7(1+{s}^{2})}{s} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{7}{s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is valid for $s>0.$\n\nNow, taking the inverse Laplace transform, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}(Y(s)) & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{7}{s}} \\\\ y(t) & =7{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s}} \\\\ y(t) & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379479 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379480 13194139536015 true] [17592186379479 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536015 true] [17592186379479 1041 "field-1" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379479 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379480 13194139536015 true] [17592186379479 1110 #uuid "54204d03-1bb2-5f56-b7bb-bc580952fbf9" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379480 1034 "7" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379480 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379480 1111 #uuid "17ca2126-31aa-5417-9046-fc4cf6e430e8" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379481 1017 #edb/ref 17592186379482 13194139536015 true] [17592186379481 1089 "q-345084" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379481 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536015 true] [17592186379481 1100 "Find $y(t)$ given that the Laplace transform of the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}(t)+y(t)=2{t}^{4}+24{t}^{2},\\,y(0)=0,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=0\n$$\n\nis given by\n\n$$\n{s}^{2}Y(s)+Y(s)=\\frac{48(1+{s}^{2})}{{s}^{5}}.\n$$\n\nThe solution is $y(t)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379481 1113 #uuid "53011fc0-463a-5123-b45a-cadefcb42935" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379481 1145 "Using the transformed equation, we can solve for $Y(s)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{s}^{2}Y(s)+Y(s) & =\\frac{48(1+{s}^{2})}{{s}^{5}} \\\\ ({s}^{2}+1)Y(s) & =\\frac{48(1+{s}^{2})}{{s}^{5}} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{48}{{s}^{5}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is valid for $s>0.$\n\nNow, taking the inverse Laplace transform, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}(Y(s)) & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{48}{{s}^{5}}} \\\\ y(t) & =2{L}^{-1}{\\frac{24}{{s}^{5}}} \\\\ y(t) & =2{t}^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379482 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379483 13194139536015 true] [17592186379482 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536015 true] [17592186379482 1041 "field-1" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379482 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379483 13194139536015 true] [17592186379482 1110 #uuid "76532c76-92fd-5b14-90d5-ad97b24000b0" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379483 1034 "2t^4" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379483 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379483 1111 #uuid "f2c2f855-54cc-5fe7-bff6-722f44637bd9" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379484 1017 #edb/ref 17592186379485 13194139536015 true] [17592186379484 1089 "q-83344" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379484 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536015 true] [17592186379484 1100 "Find the Laplace transform of $y(t),$ if \n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t),\\,y(0)=0,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=0.\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379484 1113 #uuid "96144212-9114-5fc2-80e5-379d5ef7a54d" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379484 1145 "First, we take the Laplace transform of both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{y}^{″}} & =L{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's introduce $L{y}=Y(s).$ \n\nTo calculate $L{{y}^{″}},$ we use the formula for the Laplace transform of a second derivative:\n\n$$\nL{{y}^{″}}={s}^{2}L{y}-sy(0)-{y}^{′}(0)={s}^{2}Y(s)-sy(0)-{y}^{′}(0)\n$$\n\nTaking into account the given initial conditions, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{y}^{″}}={s}^{2}Y(s).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the table of Laplace transforms, we have the following result:\n\n$$\nL{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)}=\\frac{2}{{s}^{2}+4}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{y}^{″}} & =L{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)} \\\\ {s}^{2}Y(s) & =\\frac{2}{{s}^{2}+4} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{2}{{s}^{2}({s}^{2}+4)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379485 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379486 13194139536015 true] [17592186379485 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379487 13194139536015 true] [17592186379485 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379488 13194139536015 true] [17592186379485 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379489 13194139536015 true] [17592186379485 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379490 13194139536015 true] [17592186379485 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536015 true] [17592186379485 1041 "selection" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379485 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379487 13194139536015 true] [17592186379485 1110 #uuid "8f9199ca-e0bd-53d4-a735-07e5a01345f6" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379486 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{2{s}^{2}}{{s}^{2}+2}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379486 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379486 1111 #uuid "9e8574b8-47bb-5131-8160-dba8654e1cdd" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379487 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{2}{{s}^{2}({s}^{2}+4)}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379487 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379487 1111 #uuid "5387bf07-eb79-5513-b9fa-f101e0ece918" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379488 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{2{s}^{2}}{{s}^{2}+4}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379488 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379488 1111 #uuid "aa3e7705-7ef0-51d2-8802-8384517fffbe" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379489 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{1}{2{s}^{2}({s}^{2}+4)}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379489 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379489 1111 #uuid "252a2822-33c9-5ec5-9a21-5fa03f0ec6f4" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379490 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{2}{s({s}^{2}+2)}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379490 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379490 1111 #uuid "5bc20064-ff9c-5942-92c9-2f180b317f4e" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379491 1017 #edb/ref 17592186379492 13194139536015 true] [17592186379491 1089 "q-83345" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379491 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536015 true] [17592186379491 1100 "Find the Laplace transform of $y(t),$ if \n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=t,\\,y(0)=0,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=1.\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379491 1113 #uuid "7d20a9b4-1729-5832-9ee1-d11c22dc11d4" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379491 1145 "First, we take the Laplace transform of both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{y}^{″}} & =L{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's introduce $L{y}=Y(s).$ \n\nTo calculate $L{{y}^{″}},$ we use the formula for the Laplace transform of a second derivative:\n\n$$\nL{{y}^{″}}={s}^{2}L{y}-sy(0)-{y}^{′}(0)={s}^{2}Y(s)-sy(0)-{y}^{′}(0)\n$$\n\nTaking into account the given initial conditions, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{y}^{″}}={s}^{2}Y(s)-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the table of Laplace transforms, we have the following result:\n\n$$\nL{t}=\\frac{1}{{s}^{2}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{y}^{″}} & =L{t} \\\\ {s}^{2}Y(s)-1 & =\\frac{1}{{s}^{2}} \\\\ {s}^{2}Y(s) & =\\frac{1}{{s}^{2}}+1 \\\\ {s}^{2}Y(s) & =\\frac{{s}^{2}+1}{{s}^{2}} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{{s}^{2}+1}{{s}^{4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379492 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379493 13194139536015 true] [17592186379492 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379494 13194139536015 true] [17592186379492 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379495 13194139536015 true] [17592186379492 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379496 13194139536015 true] [17592186379492 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379497 13194139536015 true] [17592186379492 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536015 true] [17592186379492 1041 "selection" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379492 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379493 13194139536015 true] [17592186379492 1110 #uuid "a1f73d28-275e-5d7d-b0bf-bdcf83caf893" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379493 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{{s}^{2}+1}{{s}^{4}}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379493 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379493 1111 #uuid "4eb7ea4a-3c91-598d-92f2-7e0564a1dc30" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379494 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{s+1}{{s}^{2}}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379494 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379494 1111 #uuid "126d70b3-1747-5e96-a336-264a3603113d" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379495 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{s+1}{{s}^{3}}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379495 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379495 1111 #uuid "f6b0afe9-454a-5a1c-8631-627b90b2e99c" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379496 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{{s}^{4}+1}{{s}^{2}}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379496 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379496 1111 #uuid "cdbb5626-8023-5a6c-9f3e-d1f65a38cc5f" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379497 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{{s}^{3}+1}{{s}^{4}}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379497 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379497 1111 #uuid "ddf768b6-738e-5b1a-a0d9-1b875a9da90a" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379498 1017 #edb/ref 17592186379499 13194139536015 true] [17592186379498 1089 "q-83349" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379498 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139536015 true] [17592186379498 1100 "Find the Laplace transform of $y(t),$ if \n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-{y}^{′}-2y=1,\\,y(0)=0,\\,{y}^{′}(0)=0.\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379498 1113 #uuid "a0460607-3703-5b65-ac28-ed82b0bd3298" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379498 1145 "First, we take the Laplace transform of both sides and use the addition and scalar multiplication properties of the Laplace transform:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{y}^{″}-{y}^{′}-2y} & =L{1} \\\\ L{{y}^{″}}-L{{y}^{′}}-2L{y} & =L{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's introduce $L{y}=Y(s).$\n\nTo calculate $L{{y}^{′}}$ and $L{{y}^{″}},$  we use formulas for the Laplace transforms of the derivatives and apply the initial conditions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{y}^{′}} & =sY(s)-y(0)=sY(s) \\\\ L{{y}^{″}} & ={s}^{2}Y(s)-sy(0)-{y}^{′}(0)={s}^{2}Y(s)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the table of Laplace transforms, we have the following result:\n\n$$\nL{1}=\\frac{1}{s}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can solve for $Y(s):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{y}^{″}}-L{{y}^{′}}-2L{y} & =L{1} \\\\ {s}^{2}Y(s)-sY(s)-2Y(s) & =\\frac{1}{s} \\\\ ({s}^{2}-s-2)Y(s) & =\\frac{1}{s} \\\\ (s+1)(s-2)Y(s) & =\\frac{1}{s} \\\\ Y(s) & =\\frac{1}{s(s+1)(s-2)}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379499 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379500 13194139536015 true] [17592186379499 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379501 13194139536015 true] [17592186379499 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379502 13194139536015 true] [17592186379499 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379503 13194139536015 true] [17592186379499 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379504 13194139536015 true] [17592186379499 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536015 true] [17592186379499 1041 "selection" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379499 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379503 13194139536015 true] [17592186379499 1110 #uuid "90c8d0b3-6716-55bb-abfa-a2971aad16f3" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379500 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{{s}^{2}+1}{s(s+1)(s-2)}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379500 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379500 1111 #uuid "3537a214-54ac-5508-b261-a67bd8ee5fa5" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379501 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{s}{(s+1)(s-2)}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379501 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379501 1111 #uuid "76c7b1d3-3196-5efa-b944-5bfd9399805d" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379502 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{(s+1)(s-2)}{s}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379502 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379502 1111 #uuid "cb9e75e8-3857-56e5-8d92-963124d94993" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379503 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{1}{s(s+1)(s-2)}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379503 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379503 1111 #uuid "2d89d86d-3260-5175-b038-0aac6a3e7fae" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379504 1034 "Y(s)=\\frac{1}{s({s}^{2}+s+1)}" 13194139536015 true] [17592186379504 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536015 true] [17592186379504 1111 